Subject: [PATCH 3/7] =?UTF-8?q?fix(compose):=20corrige=20el=20contexto=20d?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20construcci=C3=B3n=20de=20api=20y=20worker=20y=20el=20arranq?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ue=20de=20Redis=20sin=20capacidades?=
